IPolicyMethodPauseTest
├── when the selectors are derived
│   └── it should match each function's canonical signature
├── when Paused is emitted
│   └── it should index and order its fields as specified
├── when Unpaused is emitted
│   └── it should index and order its fields as specified
├── when the compiled abi is read
│   └── it should list exactly the specified functions events and errors
├── when pause is read from the abi
│   └── it should declare the specified parameters returns and mutability
├── when unpause is read from the abi
│   └── it should declare the specified parameters returns and mutability
├── when paused is read from the abi
│   └── it should declare the specified parameters returns and mutability
├── when the event Paused is read from the abi
│   └── it should declare the specified parameters
└── when the event Unpaused is read from the abi
    └── it should declare the specified parameters
